=== Cvar wiring sketch (location TBD — likely shared/Cvar.pas RegisterCvars) ===
Set the GoldenMaster.pas globals from cvars during init, e.g.:
  GoldenScenario   := gm_scenario.Value;
  GoldenMaxTicks   := gm_maxticks.Value;
  GoldenTraceFile  := gm_tracefile.Value;
  GoldenMasterSeed := gm_seed.Value;        // if a seed cvar is added
These are read once before the AppOnIdle loop begins. All gm_* cvars should themselves be
declared under {$IFDEF GOLDENMASTER} so they do not exist in release builds.
